@startuml
title lobster-polarion - System Context

actor "Human/CI" as Human
rectangle "lobster-polarion" as Tool
cloud "Polarion instance\nSOAP API" as Polarion
folder "YAML configuration\npolarion-config.yaml" as Config
file "Optional input\nLOBSTER .lobster file" as Input
file "Output\n<configured .lobster path>\nDefault: polarion.lobster" as Output
folder "~/.netrc" as Netrc
rectangle "LOBSTER interchange\nand report tools" as LobsterCore
rectangle "Console" as Console

Human --> Tool : CLI
Config --> Tool : YAML\nconfiguration
Input --> Tool : .lobster JSON\n(any supported schema;\nunresolved req references)
Netrc --> Tool : login/password\nfallback credentials
Tool --> Polarion : SOAP query\nSOAP over HTTPS + auth
Polarion --> Tool : SOAP work items\nfields and relationships
Tool --> Output : .lobster JSON\nPolarion work items
Tool --> Console : progress, warnings,\nerrors, exit code
Output --> LobsterCore : .lobster interchange\nJSON artifact

note right of Tool
Single black-box boundary.

Import modes:
import_query or import_tagged.
end note

@enduml
